# Sync cut - both locked, no fade at all, and the swap on a bar line.
#
# The two tracks are counting the same bars before anything is heard of the second one, so
# the cut lands where the ear already expects a change. Then eight bars to hand the tempo
# back, by which time the old track is long gone and nobody is comparing.

name    Sync cut
note    locked, then cut on the bar - no fade at all
bars    16
align   beat
power   free

lane out gain
    bar 0     1.0    hold
    bar 8     0.0    hold
    bar 16    0.0    hold

lane in gain
    bar 0     0.0    hold
    bar 8     1.0    hold
    bar 16    1.0    hold

lane in tempo
    bar 0     0.0    hold
    bar 8     0.0    smooth
    bar 16    1.0    hold
